  "description": "On the very day he decided to confess his feelings to his female friend Ju-Yeong, whom he had a crush on, he suddenly comes out to him. Flustered, Jae-Won not only lied, saying, “Actually, I like guys too!” but also ended up arranging a double date on the spur of the moment. To save face, he asks his friend Yu-Won to pretend to be his boyfriend, but… on the day of the date, when he finds out that the girlfriend Ju-Yeong brought along is actually Yu-Won’s ex, the double date spirals into chaos…?\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
